    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ludaro: Trials of the Eternal Board \ud83c\udfb2\u2728</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dice are in motion. The board is shifting. Every choice, every roll, every twist brings you closer to victory\u2014or disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Every roll is an opportunity\u2014but will you take it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf Stack game-changing powers, defy the odds, and rewrite the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 The board is alive, and it won\u2019t go down without a fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Wishlist now and prepare for the trials ahead!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>250+ Unique and Mind blowing Spirit Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/767fa8f742d9a17ae128090499476815.poster.avif?t=1752091756\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/767fa8f742d9a17ae128090499476815.webm?t=1752091756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/767fa8f742d9a17ae128090499476815.mp4?t=1752091756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf Spirit Cards: Where Power is Born</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each passing round, you\u2019ll collect Spirit Cards\u2014artifacts of pure chaos and strategy that reshape the game itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Double, triple, or even square your best rolls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Alter the board, creating pathways to untold riches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Summon mysterious creatures that grant unexpected bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad Stack passive effects until reality bends to your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same. No two players will ever take the same path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pawns have special abilities and there are tons of them\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/3102e18ca1934e79ccfae1bb70b0b7e2.poster.avif?t=1752091756\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/3102e18ca1934e79ccfae1bb70b0b7e2.webm?t=1752091756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/3102e18ca1934e79ccfae1bb70b0b7e2.mp4?t=1752091756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 Roll the Dice, Play Your Way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rolling the dice isn\u2019t just about luck\u2014it\u2019s about timing, planning, and taking the right risks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 You always know what\u2019s still possible\u2014but never what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Play it safe, or push your luck for massive rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Every roll is a moment of strategy\u2014will you take control, or embrace the chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The right move at the right time can change everything. Will you take the risk?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand Crafted Fun Unique Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/5a9f16488fb7fefa28ad732495db2f9d.poster.avif?t=1752091756\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/5a9f16488fb7fefa28ad732495db2f9d.webm?t=1752091756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/5a9f16488fb7fefa28ad732495db2f9d.mp4?t=1752091756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 The Rules Keep Changing\u2026 Can You Keep Up?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every so often, a new challenge strikes, forcing you to adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Certain rolls become unusable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Your gains get slashed in half.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 The board transforms beneath your feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you outmaneuver the chaos, you grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your Spirit Cards be enough to defy the board itself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open Exciting Packs for the surprises</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/4fff8893b4a31b55166c05d9fd049f88.poster.avif?t=1752091756\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/4fff8893b4a31b55166c05d9fd049f88.webm?t=1752091756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/4fff8893b4a31b55166c05d9fd049f88.mp4?t=1752091756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 Stack Powers, Build Your Own Luck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll unlock wild and unpredictable upgrades that push every run to new heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb4 Spirit Cards that change the way you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Abilities that make every roll stronger, riskier, or more rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Creatures that reshape the board and unlock hidden opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad Effects that combine, stack, and lead to explosive turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you craft a strategy built for success, or embrace the chaos and see where the dice take you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you beat the score to be the ultimate Champion !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/a82c92a93cc44a43b6dcb085cfbdbf29.poster.avif?t=1752091756\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/a82c92a93cc44a43b6dcb085cfbdbf29.webm?t=1752091756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/a82c92a93cc44a43b6dcb085cfbdbf29.mp4?t=1752091756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 A Tactical Dice System \u2013 Rolling isn\u2019t just luck\u2014it\u2019s about timing, risk, and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Ever-Changing Challenges \u2013 The board, the rules, and the game itself shift as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf Stackable Power-Ups \u2013 Spirit Cards combine in wild and unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Challenging Boss Rounds \u2013 Survive game-altering twists that force you to rethink your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 High-Risk, High-Reward Gameplay \u2013 Fortune favors the bold. How far will you push your luck?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Ludaro is more fun with friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Get tips, \ud83c\udccf discuss cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udf81 Unlock exclusive rewards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd17 Join us on Discord\u00a0</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WISHLIST LUDARO TO BEGIN THE EPIC JOURNEY</h2>",
